{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to <i>Hamachi the Psychotic Killer</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/21d3914019014dee1d5e3a43a3c40054.avif?t=1763512248\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras_big/21d3914019014dee1d5e3a43a3c40054.avif?t=1763512248 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>The platformer game where you can play as the BAD GUY.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/85207609fcf0f90e1f1b5768cd3bd55b.avif?t=1763512248\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras_big/85207609fcf0f90e1f1b5768cd3bd55b.avif?t=1763512248 width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hamachi the Psychotic Killer is a platform game where you take on the role of Hamachi, a civilian who just happened to be in the wrong place at the wrong time, now under control by the Great Demonic Queen, <i>Demon Queen Deity</i>, who wishes to influence Hamachi to take innocent lives in order to conquer the world.  </strong>     <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/13870d9434c86d72838ca238d2290774.avif?t=1763512248\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras_big/13870d9434c86d72838ca238d2290774.webp?t=1763512248 width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every character you encounter isn't just an obstacle, they're part of a living world. You can choose to kill or spare them, which shapes your path into one of  three routes in the story: Pacifist, Neutral, or Genocide. You can also spare the main bosses, who will then join your party to help Hamachi defeat Demon Queen Deity. \u00a0</strong> <br><br><strong>This feature will be more fully realized in the full release of the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/b3850cf25b9f9685c94293cfc0ebff39.poster.avif?t=1763512248\" width=800 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/b3850cf25b9f9685c94293cfc0ebff39.webm?t=1763512248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/b3850cf25b9f9685c94293cfc0ebff39.mp4?t=1763512248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you decide to abide by the Demons wishes, then you will slaughter innocent civilians and paint the town red with Hamachi's weapon of choice: The Axe. </strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/0dc1b5441eb8ad30a6fd55e3b07b621e.avif?t=1763512248\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras_big/0dc1b5441eb8ad30a6fd55e3b07b621e.webp?t=1763512248 width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/76014fe74e54db21d57c6e712f98a70f.poster.avif?t=1763512248\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/76014fe74e54db21d57c6e712f98a70f.webm?t=1763512248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/76014fe74e54db21d57c6e712f98a70f.mp4?t=1763512248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Occasionally, you\u2019ll come across a chainsaw that grants invincibility and kills anything you touch! </strong><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/c99f8f0575ddf34af3f488526c0aa92a.avif?t=1763512248\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras_big/c99f8f0575ddf34af3f488526c0aa92a.webp?t=1763512248 width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/f1fffabbb45dddb462ea1679e4249809.poster.avif?t=1763512248\" width=800 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/f1fffabbb45dddb462ea1679e4249809.webm?t=1763512248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/f1fffabbb45dddb462ea1679e4249809.mp4?t=1763512248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With blood fresh on your hands you're now wanted by the police. Run away, or they will catch you. </strong><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/99f9c764a8ae3cfc4617d1d043e3b1e4.avif?t=1763512248\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras_big/99f9c764a8ae3cfc4617d1d043e3b1e4.avif?t=1763512248 width=1560 height=974 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/13ad4466a37ca4ce1ffd90968b1914b0.poster.avif?t=1763512248\" width=800 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/13ad4466a37ca4ce1ffd90968b1914b0.webm?t=1763512248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/13ad4466a37ca4ce1ffd90968b1914b0.mp4?t=1763512248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The current iteration of  early access  offers 4 playable worlds, and 3 Challenge Levels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/391662bf3f48d7a654646ad0dde4531b.avif?t=1763512248\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras_big/391662bf3f48d7a654646ad0dde4531b.webp?t=1763512248 width=1560 height=975 /></span><strong>Challenge Levels are shorter levels that offer more difficulty, new levels unlock through updates over time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/30b5856b19404589833c965757d2a9fe.avif?t=1763512248\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras_big/30b5856b19404589833c965757d2a9fe.webp?t=1763512248 width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>features: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as the Villain.</strong><br>Control Hamachi and decide to Kill or Spare innocent lives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Morality</strong><br>Killing, Sparing or remaining Neutral leads to one of the three main endings of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Routes</strong><br>Explore three distinct routes: Pacifist, Neutral, or Genocide, plus a hidden ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Police Threat</strong>\u00a0<br>Killing draws law enforcement, evade arrest or face the consequences for your crimes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Encounters</strong><br>Defeat Demonic Bosses or Spare them, and they may join your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visuals and Sound</strong><br>All-original, vibrant pixel art paired with an energetic soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chainsaw Power-up</strong><br>Become temporarily Invincible and kill anything you touch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Premium Sushi</strong> <br>Sushi delivered by Penelope Pom Pom Pink to keep Hamachi at peak performance.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Created with love by mostly one person.</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3355690?t=1763512248","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3355690?t=1763512248","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/8b6f989d054dac5050cb4d83df133ca107ac1d77/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763512248","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/8b6f989d054dac5050cb4d83df133ca107ac1d77/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763512248","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Part