bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/76014fe74e54db21d57c6e712f98a70f.poster.avif?t=1763512248\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/76014fe74e54db21d57c6e712f98a70f.webm?t=1763512248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/76014fe74e54db21d57c6e712f98a70f.mp4?t=1763512248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Occasionally, you\u2019ll come across a chainsaw that grants invincibility and kills anything you touch! </strong><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/c99f8f0575ddf34af3f488526c0aa92a.avif?t=1763512248\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras_big/c99f8f0575ddf34af3f488526c0aa92a.webp?t=1763512248 width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/f1fffabbb45dddb462ea1679e4249809.poster.avif?t=1763512248\" width=800 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/f1fffabbb45dddb462ea1679e4249809.webm?t=1763512248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/f1fffabbb45dddb462ea1679e4249809.mp4?t=1763512248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With blood fresh on your hands you're now wanted by the police. Run away, or they will catch you. </strong><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" st